rayed the order and unleashed the Last Season—a plague of stagnation that drains life, warps minds, and spreads unstoppable corruption. Armed with the last remnants of seasonal magic, the surviving Wardens must reclaim their lost power and push back against the corruption that has ravaged their land. Each Warden brings a unique approach to battle, shaping the fight from the very first card played.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/1814b30d0f374fa4494534378dfdcb1f.avif?t=1784131817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras_big/1814b30d0f374fa4494534378dfdcb1f.avif?t=1784131817 width=800 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/ed28ccf9c3f94c7ff0f0ceab0b9216df.poster.avif?t=1784131817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/ed28ccf9c3f94c7ff0f0ceab0b9216df.webm?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/ed28ccf9c3f94c7ff0f0ceab0b9216df.mp4?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Wardens are the last force standing between corruption and survival. You can choose between three of them, each tied to two unique starting decks with different playstyles. Experiment with different strategies, refine your deck as you progress, and discover powerful new synergies with each run. With every failed attempt, you’ll grow stronger, unlocking new decks and gaining access to even more potent and complex runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopl